1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,002
Then the turn.

2
00:00:01,002 --> 00:00:09,322
The actress stops acting outraged and studies the wife appraisingly, like a practical person looking for an opening.

3
00:00:09,322 --> 00:00:12,434
This is a very interesting case, she says.

4
00:00:12,434 --> 00:00:14,140
Were you affectionate once?

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,872
Getting on badly lately?

6
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:20,625
Then her theory: your husband is playing a little comedy to make you jealous.

7
00:00:20,625 --> 00:00:23,528
It happens, she says, endless times to actresses.

8
00:00:23,528 --> 00:00:32,981
And every clue becomes part of the trick: the flowers were ordered and cancelled, the letter was planted, the lock of hair came from a bribed hairdresser.

